note bay 3 review of 2d6ed949: execenv whose environment packet is well formed but 4097 bytes (one record of
note 4093 bytes), one past the 4096-byte cap that the environment keeps under omc 564c5835, traps 3 before any
note kernel call (OMEGESE s10); the exec argument caps (65536 bytes) must not reach the environment packet.
fn main to int
a = new uchar 5 1
put a 1 0
put a 3 0
put a 4 120
b = new uchar 4097 65
put b 0 1
put b 1 0
put b 2 253
put b 3 15
k = execenv a 0 5 b 0 4097
ret int and k 255
